{
  "name": "Cara — Agent 1: Outbound Call",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Agent 1 — Outbound Call\n\nTrigger: webhook from the CRM (lib/n8n.ts → N8N_WEBHOOK_NEW_LEAD).\nAction: place an ElevenLabs outbound AI call.\n\n### Before activating\n1. In the **Call ElevenLabs** node, replace `REPLACE_WITH_AGENT_ID`,\n   `REPLACE_WITH_AGENT_PHONE_NUMBER_ID`, and the `xi-api-key` header value\n   `REPLACE_WITH_ELEVENLABS_API_KEY` (move to a credential for production).\n2. Copy this node's Production webhook URL into the CRM env\n   `N8N_WEBHOOK_NEW_LEAD`.\n3. `lead_id` and `call_type` are sent as ElevenLabs dynamic_variables so they\n   round-trip in the post-call webhook (Agent 2).",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "note1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-80, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "new-lead",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook1",
      "name": "Webhook — New Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [400, 100],
      "webhookId": "cara-new-lead"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/convai/twilio/outbound-call",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "xi-api-key", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_ELEVENLABS_API_KEY" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"agent_id\": \"REPLACE_WITH_AGENT_ID\",\n  \"agent_phone_number_id\": \"REPLACE_WITH_AGENT_PHONE_NUMBER_ID\",\n  \"to_number\": \"{{ $json.body.phone }}\",\n  \"conversation_initiation_client_data\": {\n    \"dynamic_variables\": {\n      \"lead_id\": \"{{ $json.body.leadId }}\",\n      \"call_type\": \"{{ $json.body.callType }}\",\n      \"lead_name\": \"{{ $json.body.name }}\",\n      \"interest\": \"{{ $json.body.interest }}\",\n      \"prior_context\": \"{{ $json.body.context }}\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http1",
      "name": "Call ElevenLabs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [640, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": \"calling\", \"leadId\": $('Webhook — New Lead').item.json.body.leadId } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond1",
      "name": "Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [880, 100]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook — New Lead": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Call ElevenLabs", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Call ElevenLabs": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Respond", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {}
}
